OpenSSL 3.5.9 (libcrypto)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

pgcrypto links a static libcrypto built from the OpenSSL 3.5.9 release
source (https://github.com/openssl/openssl/releases/tag/openssl-3.5.9),
distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, reproduced in
OPENSSL-LICENSE:

    Copyright (c) 1998-2026 The OpenSSL Project Authors
    Copyright (c) 1995-1998 Eric A. Young, Tim J. Hudson

It is compiled for wasm32-wasip1 without assembly, threads, sockets,
engines, loadable modules or configuration autoloading; no OpenSSL source
file is modified.
